<section class="bg-brand-navy py-24 px-8">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-[2rem] p-12 text-brand-navy flex flex-col h-full">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-4xl mb-6">1. Positioning</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xl leading-relaxed flex-grow">
          Optimising your positioning is the foundation that makes you look
          the business and mean the part. Clean and intentional positioning
          signals that you're an established pro.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-[2rem] p-12 text-brand-navy flex flex-col h-full">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-4xl mb-6">2. Content</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xl leading-relaxed flex-grow">
          Your LinkedIn personal brand helps your potential buyers show who
          you are, why you exist, how you help, & that you're fun to follow.
        </p>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-brand-ice rounded-[2rem] p-12 text-brand-navy flex flex-col h-full">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-4xl mb-6">3. Outreach</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xl leading-relaxed flex-grow">
          When your messages focus on curiosity, value, and low-risk next
          steps, you can start conversations with ideal clients without
          feeling salesy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
